  "text": "Category: Repair and Service\nTitle: Service for Your Fridge\n\nYour fridge produces strange noises. You describe the symptoms, and send them\ntogether with the type of fridge to the central fridge service center.  They\nselect a local service facility (which all have their own way of interacting\nwith customers).\n\nThe service facility makes an appointment. They arrive at a random time, and\nsometimes have to leave without repairing your fridge, because they need\nadditional parts.\n\nAfter your fridge is repaired, you have to confirm that it is OK again. You\ncan rate the service facility.\n",
